# CODEOWNERS — Elite Memo Pro
#
# The `main` branch ruleset enables "Require review from Code Owners"
# (require_code_owner_review: true). This file is the source of truth that rule
# reads: with no CODEOWNERS file present, the rule has no owners to match and
# therefore enforces nothing. Adding this file closes that gap.
#
# GitHub requests the listed owner(s) as reviewers on any pull request that
# changes a matching path, and — on `main` — keeps the merge blocked until a
# code owner has approved.
#
# The last matching pattern wins.
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

